 connects this input to the word 'reverse', indicating the operation being =
performed.  Another rightward-pointing arrow then connects 'reverse' to the=
 output string 'racecar', also enclosed in double quotes, positioned on the=
 right.  The arrangement visually depicts the transformation of the input s=
