<p>A palindrome of odd length is different because it has a middle characte=
r. In this case, the middle character can be ignored since it has no =E2=80=
=9Cmirror=E2=80=9D character elsewhere in the string.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
