ndrome.  A series of nested rectangular boxes are drawn underneath the lett=
ers. The outermost box encloses all the letters, representing the entire st=
ring.  Inner boxes are nested around the 'a', 'c', and 'r' letters on both =
sides of the central 'e', visually demonstrating the comparison of characte=
rs from the beginning and end of the string moving inwards. The structure i=
mplies that the algorithm iteratively compares characters from the outer en=
